uplink-job-runner-kit-name = Job Runner Kit
uplink-job-runner-kit-desc = Pay half your telecrystal budget in exchange for access to a lucrative job board. It can provide you with telecrystal rewards in exchange for completing bonus objectives.

uplink-manhunter-kit-name = Manhunter Kit
uplink-manhunter-kit-desc = Pay your entire telecrystal budget in exchange for access to a kit. You have a special vest, a special baton and access to a unique contractor uplink. Kidnap targets in exchange for more gear. You don't get any lethal weapons.